    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotlime</strong> is a brutal arcade brawler where citrus heroes clash inside a skyscraper of madness. Each floor is a bloody arena, and every lemon fights for survival, a chance to rise, and maybe\u2014 just maybe \u2014 escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is everywhere: weapons scatter the floor, levels collapse, and every drop of booze fuels the chaos. The bartender below knows more than she says\u2026 but she only speaks to winners. Expect frenzied matches \u00e0 la <i>Duck Game</i>, the neon violence of <i>Hotline Miami</i>, and so much juice you\u2019ll need to wipe your screen after every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time to think \u2014 only to strike, dodge, and drink. Victory comes to those who act fast, fight dirty, and embrace the sour madness. When life gives you lemon friends\u2026 it\u2019s time to make lemonade out of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f 2\u20134 player PVP (local &amp; online) \u2014 one hit kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf4b Tons of wild weapons: from lime-guns to alcoholic bombs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc3 Costumes: unlock outfits by surviving the tower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Insane levels with interactive arenas and destructible floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Juicy pixel art and a custom banging soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026And a mysterious barmaid\u2014her secret may be your only way out.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotlime</strong> is a brutal arcade brawler where citrus heroes clash inside a skyscraper of madness. Each floor is a bloody arena, and every lemon fights for survival, a chance to rise, and maybe\u2014 just maybe \u2014 escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is everywhere: weapons scatter the floor, levels collapse, and every drop of booze fuels the chaos. The bartender below knows more than she says\u2026 but she only speaks to winners. Expect frenzied matches \u00e0 la <i>Duck Game</i>, the neon violence of <i>Hotline Miami</i>, and so much juice you\u2019ll need to wipe your screen after every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time to think \u2014 only to strike, dodge, and drink. Victory comes to those who act fast, fight dirty, and embrace the sour madness. When life gives you lemon friends\u2026 it\u2019s time to make lemonade out of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f 2\u20134 player PVP (local &amp; online) \u2014 one hit kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf4b Tons of wild weapons: from lime-guns to alcoholic bombs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc3 Costumes: unlock outfits by surviving the tower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Insane levels with interactive arenas and destructible floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Juicy pixel art and a custom banging soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026And a mysterious barmaid\u2014her secret may be your only way out.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Hotlime \u2014 a skyscraper of madness where four citrus fighters are trapped in a juicy deathmatch! Climb through piles of pulped bodies, deadly weapons, endlessly sour cruelty, and one dangerously seductive barmaid. There\u2019s no way out!",
